# The /resume session browser: projects on the left, named sessions on the right.
Source tapes/common.tape
Output shots/resume.txt
Hide
Type 'clai-demo' Enter
Wait+Screen /\| ready/
Type '/resume' Enter
Wait+Screen /Shorter install and usage/
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot shots/resume.png
Hide
Escape
Escape
Hide
Ctrl+D
